{"title":"2025 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is one positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79cc07f6406a1d5091931bc7bb0ec1ca0055b0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 &lt; \\sqrt{k^{2} + 4} &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" />. What is this positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To get rid of the square root, we can square everything, like this:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b619502161724ecaead1d7566618ff63edd5220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} &lt; (\\sqrt{k^{2} + 4})^{2} &lt; 4^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/5291b1c66c1df372b1aae48820e2e73a647bdd5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 &lt; k^{2} + 4 &lt; 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from everything, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e327a81f615999714ca41c3afd949ef8e2b85e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 4 &lt; k^{2} + 4 - 4 &lt; 16 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da0d84b02b0a0c9077856ebd71b1fed3d5afa4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 &lt; k^{2} &lt; 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We can see that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f96a3de68cfb881f4b3cc002ec222bba93f1e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/dec8eb394bf98a314e1eeb5056647c807cbc57c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> because if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/527675d9d51f70c695a7c20f09731aac6a8a3563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\pm 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44d67d93fa36c49721c00b6105542c60cb764fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} = 16 &gt; 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" /> and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a73cb34aad22dc159866d01e3e3af8236a189c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\pm 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa700066eb376e58fa4ab5a06f9e34b2df486a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} = 4 &lt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/812bce462956acc2185968bc82d0e06d1fd15828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{k = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018031846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2929/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.374      1 2025_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.374      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35985:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018031846 and revision id 279570. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}